Third-party components

This project uses the following third-party software, under its own license,
unmodified in license terms:

- **FFmpeg** — required external dependency, installed separately by the
  user (e.g. via Chocolatey) and never bundled or redistributed by this
  repository. FFmpeg's own license depends on the specific build/flags in
  use (typically LGPL, or GPL if certain encoders/libraries are enabled) —
  see this project's own CLAUDE.md §6 for the current build/flags in use and
  the resulting obligations, which apply independently of this license.
- **MediaMTX** (MIT License, Copyright (c) 2019 aler9) — downloaded by this
  project's own setup process into `tools/mediamtx/` (not committed to this
  repository; gitignored, fetched fresh from the upstream project). See
  `tools/mediamtx/LICENSE` once downloaded for the full MIT text.

Standard npm package dependencies (see `package.json` / `web/package.json`)
each carry their own licenses via their own packages and are not
individually enumerated here — this is normal practice, not an omission.
